sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant NextJS as Next.js Server
    participant DB as Database
    participant GoProxy as Go Proxy
    participant Marimo as Marimo App<br/>(Databricks)

    User->>Browser: Navigate to /notebook-editor
    Browser->>NextJS: Request page

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over NextJS,DB: SSO-SPN Token Acquisition
        NextJS->>DB: Lookup user's SPN mapping
        DB-->>NextJS: SPN credentials (clientId, secret)
        NextJS->>Marimo: POST /oidc/v1/token<br/>(client_credentials)
        Marimo-->>NextJS: Workspace access token
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over NextJS: Token Encryption
        NextJS->>NextJS: Encrypt token with AES-256-GCM
        NextJS->>NextJS: Generate proxy URL
    end

    NextJS-->>Browser: Render page with iframe src
    Browser->>GoProxy: Request notebook app (encrypted token in URL)

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over GoProxy: Token Handling
        GoProxy->>GoProxy: Decrypt token from URL
        GoProxy->>Marimo: Forward request with Bearer token
    end

    Marimo-->>GoProxy: Notebook interface
    GoProxy-->>Browser: Proxied response
    Browser->>User: Display Marimo notebook editor

    Note over Browser,Marimo: WebSocket connections for<br/>interactive cell execution
